{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-05",
  "title": "确认交战视界",
  "storyCode": "14-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bdd8860f72d1c37c317d9b171fc322b5ad24b7aa99c76c91802547817371a0d6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明椒，明椒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！你们不要乱跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们逃跑吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我刚注意到了，那个W的雇佣兵全都跑出去了，应该是军事委员会的人已经打过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你们更应该藏好，别被飞来飞去的炮弹打到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别忘了，我们可是军事委员会雇来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们已经打过来了，这里的人迟早玩完！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在就是我们逃命的好机会。等我们见到曼弗雷德将军，一定能解释清楚的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "明椒",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们打算回到他那里去......你们还要继续留在维多利亚杀人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我哪管得了那么多！要是被将军发现我们投降了，就更没有活路了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要能活下来，他们让我去运货我就运货，让我去杀人我就杀人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯懦的佣兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要留在这就随你吧！我要走了！再见！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行动开始后五十小时"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的运气真的很好，厄尔苏拉军令长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弄丢了至关重要的战争装备，被叛军俘虏后，还能全须全尾地回来的情况并不常见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同为疤痕商场的佣兵，你和他们处得很好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闭嘴小食腐者，还轮不到你来评判我的失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎么样，厄尔苏拉军令长的存活对于军事委员会来说都是一个好消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德将军，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "血魔大君的殒没我已知晓，解释的话可以之后再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我希望你出现在这里，是带着有价值的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我带回了骸骨的位置......还有留守骸骨的佣兵的具体情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就这？听上去你留在那些雇佣兵手里还更有价值一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想听听你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巨兽骸骨无法启动，那群佣兵正在想方设法让它重启。他们接下来的打算，应该也离不开那个东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不清楚这伙雇佣兵的具体计划，但是不知为什么，他们留守骸骨的人似乎并不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫德雷，也在其中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "传令，包围这片峡谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不惜一切代价，立刻夺回脊椎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜汀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德将军，接下来的战斗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不用参与，留在后方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "将军......以防万一，我还是想请示一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厄尔苏拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果敌人抵抗激烈，我们迟迟夺不下骸骨，又该怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不喜欢听到这种假设，厄尔苏拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德的军队还是到了，比预想的要快一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "王庭军的消息呢？厄尔苏拉还是什么都没有交代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她逃走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我疏忽了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们可以回过头再算这笔账。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去外面调查战场动向了，最坏的情况，她会比我们先遭遇敌军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果厄尔苏拉回到了曼弗雷德那里，我们现在的位置，还有布防情况可能已经全部暴露。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们和敌军的战力差距过于悬殊，打持久战我们没有胜算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士他们出发已经有五十个小时了，有任何通讯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "完全没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论如何，我们要坚守到约定的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以我们的人手，想挡住军事委员会的大军一整天，只能期待一场天灾砸在曼弗雷德头上，可天灾现在还会听他们的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "军事委员会不可能允许这样一个可以威胁他们制空权的武器落在我们手里，他们一定会不惜一切代价干掉我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......只能赌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赌曼弗雷德，也并不想毁掉这具骸骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但愿你真的和你想的一样了解曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最后一个问题，如果到了时间，博士那边还没有联络怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就放弃骸骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死战没有意义，优先撤离人员，不论什么时候，留下更多活着的人才是我们最根本的第一要务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "合理的判断，我没有异议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "还有另外一个，或许可以拖缓王庭军进攻的办法......\n直接了结对方指挥官的性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿斯卡纶小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会杀了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，烂木头。听着，我没有时间和你耗着。我只有几个问题，你的回答决定了我的炸弹会不会扔到你的脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是赦罪师的祭坛，你是赦罪师？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铛——铛——\n斧头的敲凿声没有停下，保持着它慑人的节奏，仿佛亘古以来就是如此。\n怪人缓缓开口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我乃，魔王奎萨图什塔的仆从。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔王的血脉在生死中延续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若赦罪师为侍奉魔王之人，那我亦为，赦罪师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "绕来绕去......原来你会说人话的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我开炮前，还可以给你点时间自我介绍一下。还有这到底是什么地方？和赦罪师是什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Qa......lid'čoa......喀利喀......“钥匙”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这把钥匙已不再有可打开的门。如今，我不过是这幽深墓穴的......守墓人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你到底在说什么......墓穴？谁的墓穴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡兹戴尔曾经的无数英雄，还有葬送在他们手中的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“负碑者”“八英杰”“十一勇士”......他们在历史中一一陨落，不少人由我亲自送别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里埋藏的是他们的武器与甲胄，是往日的余烬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "开什么玩笑，你和这些人都打过交道，该不会是和老女人一辈的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这些老怪物真无聊，这么喜欢抱着过去的东西不放，忘了昨晚吃了什么今天就不会走路了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些从英雄时代中一跃而出的人，一次又一次地被视作拯救萨卡兹的希望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他们都失败了，变成了这墓穴中的一抔尘土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你脚下的，就是魔王奎隆的佩剑，名为青色怒火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯拒绝佩戴此剑，而将它留在此地。即便如此，你也不该将它踩在脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奎隆？他不是神话里才有的——\n你不是在忽悠我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的问题，我已经回答。该你回答，我的疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为何要闯入此地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铛——\n又一斧落下，涌来的气浪差点让W又退了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我来找赦罪师的麻烦，这里的祭坛是干什么用的，最好老实交代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祭坛的使命已然结束，除了误入当中的愚者，不会再有人来造访。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，我在问你话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "攻击徒劳，这具身体，不会再有变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "失败的容器，不得作为迎接王冠的器具永生，也不得死亡以获安息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？你也是赦罪师实验的残次品咯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是觉得自己很可怜吗？我可以帮你解脱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何必，徒劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "怪人扬起石斧，像是驱赶恼人的蝇虫，挥开了W掷过去的炸弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是说你是赦罪师造出来的不坏之躯？我倒要看看这个距离能不能把你的脑袋炸开花。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赦罪师好像总喜欢做些实验，那些大头蛾子也是你们捏出来的玩意？这个专门生产怪物的老巢还真是恶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "收起你那些听不懂的唱诗，我问什么你就答什么——你知道特蕾西娅吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "流放之人，有幸见过那位魔王......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里，就是那位悲伤的魔王，重生之处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是在这......他们......是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赦罪师带回了魔王染血的躯体，将她的魂魄从众魂中裁剪出来，但她与众魂的脐带已紧密连接。她已经无法作为自己而存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W回头看向了山洞中央的那座祭坛。\n造型狰狞的建筑散发出令人不安的气息，隐隐有污浊刺鼻的血腥味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萨卡兹的当下，需要她死去；萨卡兹的未来，需要她活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她作为魔王，决意献出自己的一切，灵与识，血与骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佣兵，你为魔王的旧部，追随魔王而来。可她已不是你所识之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看到，她在这里被唤醒，她面容悲伤；我看到，她所负灵魂之重，她的灵魂永远不得平静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够了......住口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她是祭品，献于众魂，献于卡兹戴尔，献于过去与未来所有萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闭嘴！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "烟尘滚滚，填满了整座洞穴。爆炸尚不足以宣泄愤怒，腐旧的陈设在此刻已变为一地废墟。\n在山洞深处，还剩下一座祭坛，形似门扉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空灵的呢喃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个......是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空灵的呢喃",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "W推开了那扇门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
